§§ `s 251(h)(3) the shares held after the offer`

-- One tally of stock: all the stock of the constituent corporation, or one class or series of it.
-- src:1097 | (3) Immediately following the consummation of the offer referred to in paragraph (h)(2) of this section, the stock irrevocably accepted for purchase or exchange pursuant to such offer and received by the depository prior to expiration of such offer, together with the stock otherwise owned by the consummating corporation or its affiliates and any rollover stock, equals at least such percentage of the shares of stock of such constituent corporation, and of each class or series thereof, that, absent this subsection, would be required to adopt the agreement of merger by this chapter and by the certificate of incorporation of such constituent corporation;
@ref 8 Del. C. § 251(h)(3) (src:1097)
DECLARE `s 251(h)(3) Tally of stock` HAS
    `the number of votes of the outstanding stock`                                                     IS A NUMBER
    `the number of votes of the stock irrevocably accepted for purchase or exchange in the offer and received by the depository before the offer expired` IS A NUMBER
    `the number of votes of the stock otherwise owned by the consummating corporation or its affiliates` IS A NUMBER
    `the number of votes of the rollover stock`                                                        IS A NUMBER
    `the vote that, absent s 251(h), would be required to adopt the agreement of merger by this chapter and by the certificate of incorporation` IS A `Vote requirement`

-- "equals at least such percentage ... that, absent this subsection, would be required to adopt the agreement": read as
-- reaching a holding that would have carried the vote (for a majority requirement, more than half) -- NOTES.md fork F10.
-- NOTHING (not covered) when the counts cannot be a vote.
-- src:1097 | (3) Immediately following the consummation of the offer referred to in paragraph (h)(2) of this section, the stock irrevocably accepted for purchase or exchange pursuant to such offer and received by the depository prior to expiration of such offer, together with the stock otherwise owned by the consummating corporation or its affiliates and any rollover stock, equals at least such percentage of the shares of stock of such constituent corporation, and of each class or series thereof, that, absent this subsection, would be required to adopt the agreement of merger by this chapter and by the certificate of incorporation of such constituent corporation;
@ref 8 Del. C. § 251(h)(3) (src:1097)
GIVEN tally IS A `s 251(h)(3) Tally of stock`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 251(h)(3) the stock held after the offer reaches the vote that would have been required for one tally` tally MEANS
    `the vote carries` (tally's `the vote that, absent s 251(h), would be required to adopt the agreement of merger by this chapter and by the certificate of incorporation`)
                       (  tally's `the number of votes of the stock irrevocably accepted for purchase or exchange in the offer and received by the depository before the offer expired`
                        PLUS tally's `the number of votes of the stock otherwise owned by the consummating corporation or its affiliates`
                        PLUS tally's `the number of votes of the rollover stock`)
                       (tally's `the number of votes of the outstanding stock`)

@ref 8 Del. C. § 251(h)(3) (src:1097)
GIVEN m IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 251(h)(3) the result is not covered` m MEANS
    CONSIDER m
    WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
    WHEN JUST b  THEN FALSE

@ref 8 Del. C. § 251(h)(3) (src:1097)
GIVEN m IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 251(h)(3) the result is that the requirement is met` m MEANS
    CONSIDER m
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST b  THEN b

-- The test is made for the stock of the constituent corporation "and of each class or series thereof": a list of tallies, one
-- for all the stock and one for each class or series. NOTHING if there is no tally or any tally is not covered; otherwise met
-- only if every tally is.
