@ref 8 Del. C. § 251(h)(3) (src:1097)
GIVEN tallies IS A LIST OF `s 251(h)(3) Tally of stock`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 251(h)(3) the stock held after the offer reaches the vote that would have been required for the stock and for each class or series` tallies MEANS
    IF null tallies
